    hServicios: 'Services',
    verQueHacemos: 'See what we do',
    hEquipo: 'Team',
    equipo: 'Accesibilidad Primero was founded in March 2026. We’re a small studio: you talk directly to the person who designs and builds your website.',
    retratoAlt: 'Portrait: smiling at the camera, with black thick-rimmed glasses, a beard and a dark jacket, against a blue-grey background.',
    cargo: ['Founder', 'and creative director.'],
    hCatedra: 'dicaTIC Chair',
    catedraTexto: 'We are part of the leadership of the dicaTIC Chair on the Digital Divide and Disability at the Universitat Politècnica de València. From there we drive design, technology and digital accessibility projects such as these:',
